sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant M as Main thread
    participant W as Worker
    participant R as route()
    participant DB as MySQL

    B->>M: TCP connect to :8080
    M->>W: enqueue socket + signal semaphore
    B->>W: GET /add-cart?product_id=3&quantity=2 (Cookie session_id=ab12...)
    W->>W: recv() until end of headers, then body (Content-Length)
    W->>W: parseMethod = GET, parsePath = /add-cart
    W->>R: route(method, path, raw)
    R->>DB: SELECT user_id FROM user_sessions WHERE session_id=... AND is_active
    DB-->>R: user_id = 7 (and last_activity updated)
    R->>DB: SELECT name FROM users WHERE user_id=7
    R->>R: path is /add-cart, so call addCartItem(7, 3, 2)
    R->>DB: find ACTIVE cart, check stock, INSERT or UPDATE cart_items
    DB-->>R: OK
    R-->>W: HTML page "Product added to cart"
    W->>B: HTTP/1.1 200 OK + HTML
    W->>W: closesocket(), then wait for the next request
